  song {
    tempo 122bpm
    meter 4/4
    end 116bar

    # Am(add9) | Am(add9) | Fmaj7 | G6, one chord per bar. Every part was picked in
    # blind listening rounds: the chords and climbing bass riff, the drums, the
    # octave-saw ostinato, then each section. The ostinato runs through the whole
    # song; the breaks follow the measured shape of the references (see
    # docs/research/anjunadeep-measured.md). The last bars return to the intro's
    # state, so the song loops seamlessly.
    # Grooves re-roll timing, velocity, and inclusion on every loop pass, so
    # repeated bars drift slightly instead of copying each other.
    groove deep-swing grid 1/4beat swing 0.54 timing 1/128beat velocity 0.04 probability 1 seed 122
    groove loose-hats grid 1/4beat swing 0.54 timing 1/96beat velocity 0.1 probability 0.9 seed 233
    pattern kick-four 4bar {
